&lt;p data-start=&quot;509&quot; data-end=&quot;638&quot;&gt;Du liebst den direkten Kontakt mit Menschen, überzeugst gerne persönlich und möchtest selbst beeinflussen, wie viel du verdienst?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;640&quot; data-end=&quot;681&quot;&gt;Dann bist du bei &lt;strong data-start=&quot;657&quot; data-end=&quot;666&quot;&gt;SumUp&lt;/strong&gt; genau richtig.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;683&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Jeden Tag triffst du Unternehmer*innen vor Ort – vom Café um die Ecke bis zum lokalen Einzelhändler – und unterstützt sie dabei, ihr Geschäft mit modernen Payment-Lösungen erfolgreicher zu machen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;881&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;Dabei verkaufst du nicht einfach ein Produkt. Du hilfst kleinen Unternehmen dabei, einfacher zu verkaufen, Kartenzahlungen zu akzeptieren und ihr Business weiterzuentwickeln.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1057&quot; data-end=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;n245x3&quot; data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1081&quot;&gt;🚀 Deine Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1244&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1087&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Sales Manager im Außendienst (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;übernimmst du die Verantwortung für dein eigenes Vertriebsgebiet und baust dir Schritt für Schritt dein Kundenportfolio auf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1246&quot; data-end=&quot;1273&quot;&gt;Zu deinen Aufgaben gehören:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s7qq4v&quot; data-start=&quot;1275&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Aktive Ansprache von lokalen Händler*innen und Neukundengewinnung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qhwe88&quot; data-start=&quot;1343&quot; data-end=&quot;1409&quot;&gt;Präsentation unserer innovativen Payment-Lösungen direkt vor Ort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;120jrfe&quot; data-start=&quot;1410&quot; data-end=&quot;1450&quot;&gt;Aufbau langfristiger Kundenbeziehungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tut9tb&quot; data-start=&quot;1451&quot; data-end=&quot;1523&quot;&gt;Professioneller Umgang mit Einwänden und erfolgreiche Abschlussführung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;lijtc9&quot; data-start=&quot;1524&quot; data-end=&quot;1578&quot;&gt;Eigenverantwortliche Planung deines Vertriebsgebiets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bkuwdz&quot; data-start=&quot;1579&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit deinem Team und deinem Sales Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1643&quot; data-end=&quot;1646&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;y4w75i&quot; data-start=&quot;1648&quot; data-end=&quot;1672&quot;&gt;🎯 Das bringst du mit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1674&quot; data-end=&quot;1755&quot;&gt;Du musst kein Payment-Experte sein – wichtiger ist deine Motivation für Vertrieb.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Du passt zu uns, wenn du:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;2131&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1in380n&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1881&quot;&gt;Erfahrung im Vertrieb, Außendienst, Cold Calling oder der aktiven Neukundengewinnung mitbringst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;112lhrd&quot; data-start=&quot;1882&quot; data-end=&quot;1923&quot;&gt;Spaß daran hast, auf Menschen zuzugehen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s1q0dk&quot; data-start=&quot;1924&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;ehrgeizig bist und deine Ziele erreichen möchtest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15p2ne1&quot; data-start=&quot;1976&quot; data-end=&quot;2017&quot;&gt;eigenständig und strukturiert arbeitest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1isb9zy&quot; data-start=&quot;2018&quot; data-end=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;Verantwortung übernimmst und gerne Ergebnisse lieferst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fquvqu&quot; data-start=&quot;2075&quot; data-end=&quot;2131&quot;&gt;Interesse an digitalen Produkten und Technologien hast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2133&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;vj27ly&quot; data-start=&quot;2138&quot; data-end=&quot;2161&quot;&gt;💸 Das erwartet dich&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2691&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r9z6bz&quot; data-start=&quot;2163&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2165&quot; data-end=&quot;2211&quot;&gt;Jahresgehalt von €41.000 bis €75.000 (OTE)&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1t3tkor&quot; data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2233&quot;&gt;€41.000 Fixgehalt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2dzjen&quot; data-start=&quot;2236&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot;&gt;Ungedeckelte Provision – dein Erfolg bestimmt dein Einkommen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yqv0tp&quot; data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2335&quot;&gt;Firmenwagen für deinen Außendienst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dyrkp2&quot; data-start=&quot;2336&quot; data-end=&quot;2396&quot;&gt;Professionelles Onboarding und regelmäßige Sales Trainings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12cpsej&quot; data-start=&quot;2397&quot; data-end=&quot;2459&quot;&gt;Eigenverantwortliches Arbeiten mit viel Gestaltungsspielraum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;70kmb2&quot; data-start=&quot;2460&quot; data-end=&quot;2548&quot;&gt;Klare Karriere- und Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten innerhalb eines internationalen Fintechs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dzsoph&quot; data-start=&quot;2549&quot; data-end=&quot;2589&quot;&gt;€2.000 jährliches Weiterbildungsbudget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mejwmn&quot; data-start=&quot;2590&quot; data-end=&quot;2610&quot;&gt;Corporate Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17o9lc1&quot; data-start=&quot;2611&quot; data-end=&quot;2639&quot;&gt;Urban Sports Club Zuschuss&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13mo64v&quot; data-start=&quot;2640&quot; data-end=&quot;2691&quot;&gt;Mental Health Angebote und viele weitere Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2693&quot; data-end=&quot;2696&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;xufixl&quot; data-start=&quot;2698&quot; data-end=&quot;2716&quot;&gt;🌍 Warum SumUp?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2718&quot; data-end=&quot;2779&quot;&gt;Millionen kleiner Unternehmen nutzen SumUp bereits jeden Tag.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2781&quot; data-end=&quot;2977&quot;&gt;Unsere Mission ist es, Selbstständige und Unternehmen mit einfachen und innovativen Payment-Lösungen zu unterstützen, damit sie sich auf das konzentrieren können, was wirklich zählt: ihr Geschäft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2979&quot; data-end=&quot;3133&quot;&gt;Bei uns erwarten dich kurze Entscheidungswege, eine internationale Unternehmenskultur und ein Team, das sich gegenseitig unterstützt und gemeinsam wächst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3135&quot; data-end=&quot;3138&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1ee6blv&quot; data-start=&quot;3140&quot; data-end=&quot;3170&quot;&gt;📩 Werde Teil unseres Teams&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3172&quot; data-end=&quot;3273&quot;&gt;Du möchtest im Vertrieb durchstarten, Verantwortung übernehmen und deinen Erfolg selbst beeinflussen?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3275&quot; data-end=&quot;3315&quot;&gt;Dann freuen wir uns auf deine Bewerbung.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3317&quot; data-end=&quot;3320&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3322&quot; data-end=&quot;3553&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3322&quot; data-end=&quot;3335&quot;&gt;Keywords:&lt;/strong&gt; Verkäufer, Account Manager, Account Executive, Vertriebsmitarbeiter, Key Account Manager, Außendienstmitarbeiter, Door-to-Door, Direktvertrieb, Sales Manager, Handelsvertreter, Freelancer, Freier Mitarbeiter, Vertrieb&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

fincapital-sumup:greenhouse:8291314002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h1&gt;Специалист продажби (на терен)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;За екипа&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Екипът по продажби на терен на SumUp е двигателят зад растежа ни сред търговците в цяла Европа - хората, които дават живот на нашите продукти за малкия бизнес, който има нужда от тях. В България изграждаме присъствието си и тази роля е в сърцето на този процес. Като специалист продажби на терен ще бъдеш лицето на SumUp в София - ще работиш автономно, ще се свързваш с местни бизнеси и ще им помагаш да приемат плащания по-лесно и достъпно. Ако те мотивират собствеността върху работата ти, неограничения потенциал за доходи и свободата да управляваш поверения ти район по свой начин, тази роля си заслужава вниманието ти.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎥 &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/gqtjm5NUXs0?si=t7YARvQWQHHidD_z&quot;&gt;Виж как е да работиш в SumUp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Какво ще правиш:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Изграждаш и управляваш свое собствено портфолио от малки и средни търговци в София, с фокус върху сектори като търговия на дребно, хотелиерство и ресторантьорство;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Срещаш се лично със собственици на бизнес, демонстрираш продуктите и устройствата за разплащания на SumUp и намираш правилното решение за нуждите на всеки търговец;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Привличаш нови търговци и им помагаш при регистрацията, за да започнат да обработват транзакции бързо;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Развиваш допълнителния си доход, като поддържаш силни отношения с търговците и държиш портфолиото си активно и ангажирано;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Планираш и управляваш поверения ти район самостоятелно, проследяваш собствената си активност и постигаш месечните цели за активации, за да поддържаш статус Партньор;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ще се впишеш отлично в тази роля, ако…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Имаш опит в продажби към малки или средни бизнеси, за предпочитане в търговията на дребно, хотелиерството или подобна среда, ориентирана към търговци;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Работиш&amp;nbsp; като самостоятелно заето лице и те мотивира комисионен модел с месечен дял от приходите, а не фиксирана заплата -&amp;nbsp; и можеш да отделяш минимум 3 пълни работни дни седмично за тази роля;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Чувстваш се удобно при директни посещения от врата на врата и намираш истинско удовлетворение в помощта на бизнес собствениците да намерят правилното решение за тях;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Имаш доказан опит в управлението на собствено портфолио и сключването на сделки самостоятелно;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Притежаваш силни умения за изграждане на взаимоотношения и способност бързо да спечелиш доверието на независими собственици на бизнеса;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Любопитен си по природа - търсиш обратна връзка, учиш се бързо от опита на терен и непрекъснато усъвършенстваш подхода си;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Владееш свободно български и имаш работно ниво на английски.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Защо да се присъединиш към SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Това е възможност за самостоятелна заетост в среда, създадена да поощрява добрите резултати, с които доходът ти ще бъде пряко свързан.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Как печелиш:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Започни като Партньор&lt;/strong&gt; с 10+ активации на търговци за всеки двумесечен период;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Спечели 50% от годишния нетен приход от плащания&lt;/strong&gt;, 50% от приходите от хардуер и 50% от годишния приход от софтуер за всяка сделка;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Получаваш 20% дял от нетния приход&lt;/strong&gt; на SumUp от всеки търговец – изплащан месечно до 2 години. ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Гарантиран стартов доход за първите 3 месеца като нов Партньор ;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Бонуси за постигнати цели&lt;/strong&gt;, натрупани върху базовата комисиона за достигане на TPV (total processed value)&amp;nbsp; цели и продажба на POS продукти&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Месечни изплащания&lt;/strong&gt; от плащания, хардуер, софтуер, остатъчни приходи и препоръки&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Като Партньор ще имаш достъп и до:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Насрочени срещи от Sales Development Representative екипа в подкрепа на твоето портфолио от търсивци&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Покани за партньорски събития на SumUp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Специални партньорски стимули&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Моля, имай предвид: тази роля се предлага на база самостоятелна заетост.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;_________________________________________________________________&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;За SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;В SumUp имаме&amp;nbsp; мисия да помагаме на малкия бизнес по целия свят, като предоставяме прости и достъпни инструменти, които им позволяват да процъфтяват. Днес над 4 милиона бизнеса в 37 пазара разчитат на SumUp като свой финансов партньор за управление на плащания, финанси и клиентски отношения.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ангажиментът ни към малкия бизнес се отразява в &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;нашия разнообразен екип&lt;/a&gt; от над 3 000 SumUppers от над 90 националности, обединени от глобално сътрудничество и иновативно мислене. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Нашите основни ценности&lt;/a&gt; полагат основата на това кои сме и за какво се застъпваме, оформяйки работната ни култура и движейки успеха ни. Насърчаваме приобщаването и културата на непрекъснато учене, осигурявайки безопасно пространство за личностно и професионално израстване. Различията ни ни правят уникални и силни, докато се стремим да създадем среда, в която всеки принадлежи и се чувства подкрепен, независимо от идентичността си.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp се гордее, че е работодател с равни възможности за заетост, активно търсещ и подкрепящ разнообразието в работната си сила. Не вземаме решения за наемане или заетост въз основа на раса, цвят на кожата, религия или религиозни убеждения, етнически или национален произход, националност, пол, полова идентичност, сексуална ориентация, увреждане, възраст или друга основа, защитена от приложимото законодателство или забранена от политиката на компанията. Ангажиментът ни се простира отвъд набирането на персонал до създаването на безопасно и уважително работно място, където тормозът в каквато и да е форма е строго забранен. Научи повече за нашата култура и възможности на нашия &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;уебсайт за кариери&lt;/a&gt; и следи пътуването ни в &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; и &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

foothillventures-turing-ai:greenhouse:59.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 24pt;&quot;&gt;About Turing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Based in San Francisco, California, Turing is the world’s leading research accelerator for frontier AI labs and a trusted partner for global enterprises looking to deploy advanced AI systems. Turing accelerates frontier research with high-quality data, specialized talent, and training pipelines that advance thinking, reasoning, coding, multimodality, and STEM. For enterprises, Turing builds proprietary intelligence systems that integrate AI into mission-critical workflows, unlock transformative outcomes, and drive lasting competitive advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Recognized by Forbes, The Information, and Fast Company among the world’s top innovators, Turing’s leadership team includes AI technologists from Meta, Google, Microsoft, Apple, Amazon, McKinsey, Bain, Stanford, Caltech, and MIT. Learn more at&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://www.turing.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.turing.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;www.turing.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an Engineering Lead / Architect who can own the technical direction of a complex platform modernization while staying hands-on enough to validate that direction through real delivery. This role sits at the intersection of architecture, engineering leadership, and execution—setting the runway for how we build, integrate, and evolve systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll define integration strategy, establish non-functional requirements, maintain the architecture decision log (ADRs), and ensure the team builds on patterns that hold up at scale. You’ll also be the technical conscience of the program—helping the team make pragmatic tradeoffs without accumulating hidden debt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture runway: define integration patterns, NFRs, security posture, and technical standards that the team builds against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve the technical decision log (ADRs)—capturing context, alternatives considered, and rationale so decisions remain traceable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive design reviews and ensure architectural consistency across backend services, APIs, frontend components, and data flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, DevOps, and business stakeholders to translate requirements into architecture that balances correctness, operability, and delivery speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate build-vs-buy and integration decisions with clear frameworks—especially around AKS, API gateway patterns, event-driven architecture, and workflow orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish security and audit patterns: authentication, authorization, API contracts, data classification, and audit trail design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on contribution where it matters most: proof-of-concepts, critical-path components, and reference implementations that set the quality bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through design conversations, code reviews, and architecture pairing—raising the team’s ability to make good technical decisions independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools to accelerate architecture work (analysis, documentation, pattern evaluation), while maintaining strong judgment and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience with meaningful time in architecture or technical leadership roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Java platform architecture (Spring Boot, Spring Security, modern Java) and API design (REST, contract-first, versioning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security and audit patterns: OAuth/OIDC, RBAC, API gateway design, data classification, and compliance-aware architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud-native platforms, preferably AKS/Kubernetes, and familiarity with infrastructure-as-code and deployment pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to define and enforce integration patterns across distributed teams—you can set standards without becoming a bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication: your ADRs, design documents, and technical proposals are clear, concise, and decision-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic mindset: you prefer proven patterns over novel ones, and you optimize for clarity and maintainability over cleverness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven architecture and messaging systems (Azure Event Hubs, Kafka, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow orchestration platforms (Temporal or similar) and their architectural implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience modernizing legacy platforms while maintaining business continuity—especially migrations from monolithic or component-based systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to design reviews and architecture governance in regulated or control-oriented domains (financial services, operations, accounting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;$220k - $250k Total Cash Compensation + equity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are client first&lt;/strong&gt;: We put our clients at the center of everything we do, because their success is the ultimate measure of our value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work at Start-Up Speed: &lt;/strong&gt;We move fast, stay agile and favor action because momentum is the foundation of perfection&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are AI forward: &lt;/strong&gt;We help our clients build the future of Al and implement it in our own roles and workflow to amplify productivity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advantages of joining Turing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Amazing work culture (Super collaborative &amp;amp; supportive work environment; 5 days a week)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Awesome colleagues (Surround yourself with top talent from Meta, Google, LinkedIn etc. as well as people with deep startup experience)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
